OL,3,GNEWSAAmputee completes Lake District
OL,4,AWainwright challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is thought to have become the
OL,7,Ffirst known leg amputee to complete all
OL,8,F214 Wainwright fells in the Lake
OL,9,FDistrict.
OL,11,FJoe Maden, from Barrowford, Lancashire,
OL,12,Fhad his right leg amputated below the
OL,13,Fknee after a piece of metal fell on him
OL,14,Fwhile working as a 16-year-old
OL,15,Felectrical apprentice.
OL,17,FHe said he took on the challenge after
OL,18,F"becoming bored of going up Pendle
OL,19,FHill" and spotted a book on
OL,20,Ffell-walking author and artist Alfred
OL,21,FWainwright's walks.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
